  "The camera holds while the cursor stays near the middle of the view, then drifts to follow it.": "游標停留在顯示範圍中央附近時鏡頭保持不動，之後緩緩跟隨游標。",
  "The camera needs it. Recording works without it.": "相機需要此權限。沒有它也可以錄製。",
